    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐαί</span></b> , exclam. of pain and anger, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ah! woe!</i> c. nom., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Am.</u>
				5.18
			</span></i>, al.: c. voc., ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>3 Ki.</u>
				13.30
			</span></i>: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐαί μοι, οὐαί
			σοι</span>, <i>woe is</i> me! <i>woe to</i> thee! ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Nu.</u>
				21.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				3.19.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mim.Oxy.</u>
				413.184
			</span></i>: c. acc., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐαὶ οὐαὶ οὐαὶ τοὺς κατοικοῦντας
					ἐπὶ τῆς γῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					8.13
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐαί:</span></b> 
